28:["$","section",null,{"id":"practice","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Put it to work."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"checklist","children":[["$","li","0",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":["0",1]}],"Add two required fields to every app-demo brief: “Proof object” and “Result glimpse pass condition.”"]}],["$","li","1",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":["0",2]}],"Use this review checklist before approval. Human decision 1: Can a relevant viewer tell by second 3 what finished artifact the demo claims to produce? Human decision 2: During the later inspectable return, can a reviewer read enough output to judge whether it matches the opening problem?"]}],["$","li","2",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":["0",3]}],"When comparing edits, hold the opening problem constant and test only the post-problem sequence: Version A goes straight to steps; Version B adds a brief result glimpse before the same steps."]}],["$","li","3",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":["0",4]}],"If using a delivered-account workflow, dry-run the final slot request separately to validate the current request and account state before any live action [2]."]}]]}]]}]
29:["$","section",null,{"id":"sources","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Notes & sources."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"caveat","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"The limit. "}],"Do not confuse configuration validity with persuasive proof. A dry run can confirm that one slot request is structurally valid now [2]; it cannot tell you whether the creative shows a meaningful result glimpse or an inspectable return."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"sources","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mono acid","children":"SOURCES & PROVENANCE"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","https://newsroom.tiktok.com/creator-search-insights?lang=en",{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://newsroom.tiktok.com/creator-search-insights?lang=en","children":["newsroom.tiktok.com","/creator-search-insights"]}]," ","· ","consulted September 8, 2026"]}],["$","li","https://developers.tokportal.com/use-cases/no-code/mp4-delivered-account-preview/",{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://developers.tokportal.com/use-cases/no-code/mp4-delivered-account-preview/","children":["developers.tokportal.com","/use-cases/no-code/mp4-delivered-account-preview/"]}]," ","· ","consulted September 8, 2026"]}],["$","li","https://support.tiktok.com/en/getting-started/for-you/test-for-you",{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://support.tiktok.com/en/getting-started/for-you/test-for-you","children":["support.tiktok.com","/en/getting-started/for-you/test-for-you"]}]," ","· ","consulted September 8, 2026"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"editorial-note","children":["THE ORGANIC CLUB is an editorial project initiated by TokPortal. That relationship is separate from the evidence behind claims. Editorial signatures and image credits are explained in our policy."," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/en/about/","children":"Our editorial policy →"}]]}]]}]]}]
